1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,050
Listen to an announcement at a student meeting.

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:12,292
Our mentorship program is back this year with some great new features like regularly scheduled one on one sessions

3
00:00:12,292 --> 00:00:15,140
and extra resources to support participants.

4
